WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.940
Say what you want

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:02.800
to prepare in plain English.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.880
If the instruction contains one or two
possible

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.100
amounts, the agent asks you to choose.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:10.700
It never guesses the payment.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.800
For a complete request, official Chain

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.660
MCP checks the network, balance,

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.540
recipient, fees, and read only simulation.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.000
The review shows an exact amount

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.940
and the full recipient address.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.820
You stay in control.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:25.200
Change the amount, and

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.060
the previous review becomes invalid.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.900
Cancel the action, and no

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.920
old confirmation can be reused.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.660
A new instruction needs a new review.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:38.900
After explicit confirmation and fresh
checks,

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.980
the local workspace creates an unsigned
request.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:44.800
Batches can contain up to five separate
payments.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:47.180
Your wallet must verify them independently.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.740
No private keys, signatures, or broadcasts.
